the cottage he hides for a while and  witnesses a beautiful girl fan fan  entering the house through the window  the girl starts making herself  comfortable as alexander watches in awe  soon after he confronts her and calls  her out for being a thief fan fan  defends herself and reveals that the  cottage belongs to her grandparents tai  and maude furthermore she also tells him  that she is a student at mod school  training to be a professional perfumer  and an expert in smelling various scents  after confirming her identity alexander  also discloses that ty and matt are his  close friends with the owners away from  the cottage alexander and fanfan are  forced to spend the night together in  the same room that only has a single bed  the next morning they are rejoined by  tai and mod who are very happy to see  them after taking a bath alexander takes  a look at fanfan talking to mod he has  always been attracted to her but seeing  her communicating with her grandmother  makes him even more impressed the  following day alexander returns to his  apartment and discovers his fiancee in  the bedroom dressed as an italian call  girl laura's plan was to excite him and  rejuvenate their doll relationship  however she is met with disappointment  once again when alexander ignores her  entirely before leaving the apartment  she invites alexander to meet her  parents later alexander arrives at  laura's house where he is warmly  welcomed by her father while talking to  him laura's father asks him to join his  family's funeral arrangement business an  annoyed alexander asserts that he does  not want to join the business and also  feels upset hearing laura's father's  bleak perspective on marriage somewhere  else fanfan is with her friends telling  them about a handsome man named  alexander who she is in love with she is  willing to approach him in a romantic  way but feels like something is stopping  him from going all out at the same time  things are more difficult for alexander  