e gazing  into each other's eyes the romantic date  is disturbed when alexander gets a minor  cut on his lips when he falls from a  height hence they conclude their  adventure-filled evening with a bottle  of champagne on an imagined balcony  overlooking a beautiful picture of  vienna alexander proposes a toast to  their pure relationship but titles it  friendship the comments annoy fanfan so  she asks alexander to drop her off at  her friend paul's house he is a sculptor  who is currently working on a body  design of her later alexander returns to  his apartment and is surprised to find  lore waiting for him preparing a list of  guests for their marriage when she  notices the cut on alexander's lips she  suspects that he is cheating behind her  back cheating with a porcupine maybe  strangely alexander acknowledges the  fact that he actually did meet a girl  but reassures lore that nothing will  ever come of it she listens to him and  trusts him wholeheartedly in the  following scene fanfan and alexander  hang out together as friends on a beach  in the heat of the moment fan fan gets  undressed and runs towards the ocean  into the cold water moments later she  returns and asks alexander to put some  sunscreen on her back too which he  agrees while alexander is rubbing the  lotion we can clearly see that he is  attracted to her unfortunately just as  he is about to kiss fan fan lore  unexpectedly arrives by boat she  excitedly mentions to him that the  wedding preparations are almost done  furthermore she also announces that she  is pregnant with his child fenfan is  taken aback to learn that he already has  a fiancee and that she's pregnant as a  result she slaps him hard and walks away  distracted by everything going on in her  life fanfan fails her final exams at the  same time alexander comes to know that  laura actually lied to him about being  pregnant and he is furious at her in a  fit of rage he throws away the wedding  invitation cards that laura asked him to  mail to their relatives after alexander  discards all the wedding invitations  laura herself calls off the wedding  later alexander looks for fan fan and  finds her boarding a boss to italy he  desperately tries to chase her but gives  up after some time then he visits tai  and tells him that laura's called off  the wedding tai claims that fan fan will  be in italy for 10 days and suggests  alexander go after her immediately  alexander who has decided to get her one  way or the other begins to formulate his  next strategy he rents an apartment next  to fan fans tears down the partition and  sets up a one-way mirror so that he can  see into her apartment while remaining  unnoticed oh yeah i forgot about how  creepy the beginning of this was after  10 days fan fan returns from italy and  back to her apartment she assumes that  the newly installed mirror is set up by  the landlord and doesn't see it as a  problem on the other side alexander can  be seen keeping an eye on her from that  day onwards it becomes a habit for him  to watch her every day fan fan is fond  of dancing and she often practices alone  while looking at her mirror sometimes  alexander mimics her from the other side  fan fan also has a habit of talking to  herself every night alexander silently  watches her and places his finger next  to hers although he can't feel it fan  fan wakes up the next day and takes a  bath alexander walks into the bath too  admiring fan fan through the glass  surprisingly fan fan takes the  initiative to call him and apologizes  for slapping him earlier she then tells  him that they can still be friends and  hang out together alexander is happy to  hear this and even happier when she asks  him to spend the weekend together again  at the beach cottage as friends however  the next day at the train station his  happiness turns into disappointment when  he finds out that fan fan has come with  her sculptor friend paul to make matters  worse fan fan reveals that she and paul  