om and reads the letter he immediately  calls mod and feels devastated to learn  that fanfan's sister had died a long  time ago and the only way fan fan can  see her is by committing the unthinkable  he is heartbroken and blames himself for  being too late to touch fen fan's living  body but to his surprise fan fan smashes  the glass wall between their apartments  and smiles at him alexander is so  relieved that he rushes towards her hugs  her and kisses her the movie ends as fan  fan tells alexander that he has time  until dawn to win her back subscribe for  more videos like this turn on  notifications and leave a like to help  the channel out thank you for watching

